=2 Walkthrough
* After the last mission you will end up in a CS in {z:Talacca Cove}.
** For others joining you, the closest teleport is {z:Caedarva Mire} HP#1
* Examine the **Rock Slab** directly in front of you to enter the BC.
* This is a 30 minute fight against {p:Gessho}.
** As a {p:Ninja} type monster, he can use {s:Ninjutsu}, {p:Mijin Gakure}, and ranged attacks.
** He has the ability to warp around the arena at will.
*** He tends to follow this up with a {p:TP} move.
** Has access to the following {p:TP} moves:
*** **Hane Fubuki**: Ranged attack that has the additional effect of {s:Poison}.
*** **Happobarai**: AoE damage + {s:Stun}. Absorbed by shadows.
*** **Hiden Sokyaku**: Knockback + {s:Stun}
*** **Rinpyotosha**: Warcry
*** **Shiko no Mitate**: Defense Boost
*** **Shibaraku**: AoE damage and knockback. Absorbed by shadows.
** He will periodically spawn 3-6 clones of himself during battle.
*** Each clone is relatively weak and only has around 2,000 {p:HP}.
*** The clones will despawn within about 20 seconds of being summoned, but they do not always dissapear at the same time as each other.
*** The clones can all use {s:Ninjutsu} and {p:Ninja} abilities including {p:Mijin Gakure}.
**** The clones can {p:Mijin Gakure} together with {p:Gessho}, causing massive damage.
*** The clones appear to be immune to all forms of {s:Sleep}.
** {p:Gessho} will give up at about 15% {p:HP}.
* Upon winning this battle, you'll receive the final cutscene.

